  "notes": "{強|つよ}める means to strengthen or intensify something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{強|つよ}まる→強まる：02295_tsuyomaru⟧ (intransitive, to become stronger)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{警備|けいび}→警備：00208_keibi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{強|つよ}める: to strengthen security\n- ⟦{関係|かんけい}→関係：01298_kankei⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{強|つよ}める: to strengthen a relationship\n- ⟦{姿勢|しせい}→姿勢：00371_shisei⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{強|つよ}める: to strengthen one's stance\n- ⟦{口調|くちょう}→口調：11803_kuchou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{強|つよ}める: to speak more firmly\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{強|つよ}めている indicates an ongoing state of strengthening/intensifying.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{強|つよ}まる→強まる：02295_tsuyomaru⟧: to strengthen (intransitive)\n- ⟦{強化|きょうか}する→強化する：25344_kyoukasuru⟧: to reinforce, strengthen (formal)\n- ⟦{高|たか}める→高める：02065_takameru⟧: to heighten, raise",
